WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.754 --> 00:00:09.100
The staffing board follows one shift from offers to clock-out. This tutorial uses

2
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.372
fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:16.332
Open Venue Offers in the sidebar, and select a shift.

4
00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:23.356
Along the top, Required, Filled and Open count the places on the shift, followed by

5
00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.176
a count for every lane.

6
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:31.878
The board has twelve lanes. People move from Offered and Waiting, through Staff

7
00:00:31.878 --> 00:00:38.273
Accepted and Confirmed, to Clocked in, Pending Review and Clocked out. Anyone who

8
00:00:38.273 --> 00:00:42.932
drops out moves to No Show, Rejected, Cancelled or Deleted.

9
00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:49.096
Each card shows the person and their latest state, such as when they clocked in.

10
00:00:49.562 --> 00:00:54.911
Go back to Venue Offers, and open a shift where everyone has clocked out.

11
00:00:55.363 --> 00:00:59.857
Select Timesheet report to view or download the timesheet.

12
00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:05.653
The original timesheet is available as soon as everyone has clocked out. The venue

13
00:01:05.653 --> 00:01:10.728
signed version appears after the venue manager reviews each person's hours and

14
00:01:10.728 --> 00:01:13.265
finalises the report in the mobile app.
